# A layer's view opacity: see-through on the canvas while working, never in exports.
new 32 32
wait 6
hover canvas
tool Pencil
layer Line
color 1
stroke 4,4 27,4 27,27 4,27 4,4
layer Fill
tool Fill
color 18
stroke 16,16
assert viewopacity == 100
viewopacity Fill 35
layer Fill
assert viewopacity == 35
layer Line
assert viewopacity == 100
wait 4
shot view-opacity
